    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "Event_Grave2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Sure. I don't want to kill anything, either. I just want to do a little exploring without risking my neck!#$b#I've lived in the valley my whole life, but I've never really done anything memorable. I want to go on an adventure!$8",
      "translation": "Jistě. Ani já nechci nic zabíjet. Chci se jen trochu porozhlédnout a neriskovat přitom krk!#$b#V údolí žiju celý život, ale nikdy jsem neudělala nic opravdu nezapomenutelného. Chci vyrazit za dobrodružstvím!$8",
      "sourceSHA256": "5052d7b0faf424088d4d263866881cb076c94e56931b45060e9f7bfd48466ccd",
      "translationSHA256": "2942e87bb11fa7eb03406ddb0913bf90a2eafd59efa3996f4be6a9ccc78af306",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "Event_Grave3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh, it's because I'm a girl... isn't it? Ugh...$u^Why? I'm just as strong as you!$a#$b#I'm not some fragile princess.. I can take care of myself!$a#$b#I've lived in the valley my whole life, but I've never really done anything memorable. I want to go on an adventure!$8",
      "translation": "Ach, je to proto, že jsem holka... že? Uf...$u^Proč? Jsem stejně silná jako ty!$a#$b#Nejsem žádná křehká princezna.. Umím se o sebe postarat!$a#$b#V údolí žiju celý život, ale nikdy jsem neudělala nic opravdu nezapomenutelného. Chci vyrazit za dobrodružstvím!$8",
      "sourceSHA256": "7c9a547cc790e98dd023aa18d894b833b5dbbfe9a221340dcc19717f430a5cb0",
      "translationSHA256": "15addd1f51484d539a04a26aef194ab1ebe1172e3c0a30506ba3622534efc5c0",
      "reviewChecks": [
